	(text "12 V INPUT (the logic feed): switched ACC from the car's fuse box, so the board is off\nwith the ignition. F1 3 A fuse. D10 bidirectional TVS clamps load-dump and jump-start\nspikes to about 39 V. D11 Schottky (60 V, 5 A) blocks a reversed lead. D12: +12V present."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
